title: "omni-render: a web rendering engine with a packed DOM, integer layout and a program runtime"
version: 0.1.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23282731"
abstract: "A web rendering engine for the computers people already own: packed DOM (16 B/node), own CSS engine, integer fixed-point layout, 2-bit glyph masks, a JavaScript runtime on its own IR, and a self-repair (doctor) core. Published as prior art."
